# Inside `backend/bim_research/`

1. Clarify via `specs/<topic>.md` (local) before new scripts or crawlers.
2. Put Python under `scripts/`; session notes under `chats/`; deliverables under `out/` (`.md`, `.html`, `.docx`).
3. Use `.venv/` in this directory for deps; do not install into the rest of the repo.
4. Never write outside this folder in the same turn (see always-apply 036 rule).
5. Prefer public sources; no credential stuffing or auth-wall bypass.
